      "content": "that regulatory angle is a good pivot. \n\nactually, i was talking to their CTO yesterday and he's pretty tech-savvy. he's already asking if our \"Advanced\" package covers specific zero-day vulnerabilities we might have missed during the manual audit. he basically wants to know if we can guarantee that nothing slipped through the cracks this time.\n\nif i tell him that the premium service is essentially the only way to \"guarantee\" coverage for those types of unrecorded threats, do you think that's a fair representation of the situation, or are we bordering on making promises the audit can't back up?",
